<title>FINLAND: HK-RUOKATALO TO START ON BROKERS LIST FEB 6.</title>
<headline>HK-RUOKATALO TO START ON BROKERS LIST FEB 6.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group HK-Ruokatalo Oy's 50 markka nominal value A-shares will be quoted on the Helsinki Stock Exchange's brokers' list starting February 6, the bourse said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The trading lot will be 50 shares.  </p>
<p>HK-Ruokatalo, previously LSO-Foods Oy, said last week it had applied to the Helsinki Stock Exchange to obtain a listing for its A share on the brokers's list.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
